# Native / Capacitor build artifacts (debug APKs left in the working tree).
# Callers: git status only — not imported by the app. User: "if unnecessary… gitignore… otherwise delete"
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

# Agent / IDE tooling — local only, not shipped in production packages.
# Callers: git status / packaging (flit); no runtime importer.
# Existing purpose: this .gitignore already ignored .agents/.claude/.cursor/skills|agents;
# extend to full .cursor/, tasks/, skills-lock.json. User: "I want you to ensure that
# the next commit is about those files that are not requried in production - check
# the cursor rules file, and other files that shouldn't be in production - remove them"
.agents/
.claude/
.cursor/
skills-lock.json
tasks/

# Local merge scratch — never ship in the app package
.mobile-merge-backup-*/
.mobile-backup-*/
.taxmate-backup-*/
_imports/

# Agent working prompts — not part of the app
docs/*-prompt.md
